with you</h1><ul class="2xl:w-cols-10 mx-auto my-32 flex max-w-[330px] flex-col gap-x-24 gap-y-16 md:mt-48 md:mb-32 lg:grid lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-[repeat(3,fit-content(330px))] lg:grid-rows-[repeat(5,auto)] lg:justify-center"><li class="group/card border-border-subtle hover:bg-bg-strong hover:shadow-3 relative row-span-full flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-0 gap-2 rounded-md border px-16 pt-16 pb-24 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-transparent lg:grid lg:grid-rows-[subgrid] PlanCards_card__MCsfo" data-plan="Free"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-16"><h2 class="component-heading-sm text-[20px]">Free</h2></div><p class="text-description text-gray-900-dynamic [&amp;_a]:text-link-inline mt-8 h-fit">For individuals experimenting or shipping smaller projects.</p><div class="mt-16 block flex items-end lg:h-64"><span class="component-heading-lg [translate:0_0.08em] leading-none">$</span><span class="[translate:0_0.15em] text-[48px] leading-none">0</span><span class="text-description text-foreground-tertiary ml-[0.5ch] leading-none font-medium"> <!-- -->forever</span></div><div class="my-32"><a class="_button_1my59_1" data-size="lg" data-fill="outline" data-color="primary" href="/get-started?ref=pricing-free"><span class="opacity-0 transition-opacity">Get started for free</span></a></div><div class="PlanCards_cardFeatures__8gjNb" data-plan="Free"><p><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Up to 20 user seats</li><li>2 permission roles</li><li>2 datasets (public only)</li><li>Unlimited content types and locales</li><li>Compute and Agent Actions</li><li>Hosted, real-time content database</li><li>Live previews and visual editing tools</li></ul></div></li><li class="group/card border-border-subtle hover:bg-bg-strong hover:shadow-3 relative row-span-full flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-0 gap-2 rounded-md border px-16 pt-16 pb-24 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-transparent lg:grid lg:grid-rows-[subgrid] PlanCards_card__MCsfo" data-plan="Growth"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-16"><h2 class="component-heading-sm text-[20px]">Growth</h2><div class="label-sm bg-gray-100-dynamic text-gray-700-dynamic group-hover/card:bg-gray-200-dynamic group-hover/card:text-gray-900-dynamic h-fit w-fit rounded px-6 py-6 font-medium uppercase transition-colors duration-200">We recommend</div></div><p class="text-description text-gray-900-dynamic [&amp;_a]:text-link-inline mt-8 h-fit">For teams with scaling projects and increasing collaboration needs.</p><div class="mt-16 block flex items-end lg:h-64"><span class="component-heading-lg [translate:0_0.08em] leading-none">$</span><span class="[translate:0_0.15em] text-[48px] leading-none">15</span><span class="text-description text-foreground-tertiary ml-[0.5ch] leading-none font-medium"> <!-- -->per seat / month</span></div><div class="my-32"><a class="_button_1my59_1" data-size="lg" data-fill="solid" data-color="brand" href="/get-started?ref=pricing-growth"><span class="opacity-0 transition-opacity">Try for free</span></a></div><div class="PlanCards_cardFeatures__8gjNb" data-plan="Growth"><p><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Up to 50 user seats</li><li>5 permission roles</li><li>2 datasets (private or public)</li><li>Pay-as-you-go for higher usage</li><li>Comments and Tasks</li><li>Content Releases</li><li>AI Assist</li><li>Compute and Agent Actions</li><li>Plus everything else on Free</li></ul></div></li><li class="group/card border-border-subtle hover:bg-bg-strong hover:shadow-3 relative row-span-full flex h-full w-full flex-col gap-0 gap-2 rounded-md border px-16 pt-16 pb-24 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-transparent lg:grid lg:grid-rows-[subgrid] PlanCards_card__MCsfo" data-plan="Enterprise"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-16"><h2 class="component-heading-sm text-[20px]">Enterprise</h2></div><p class="text-description text-gray-900-dynamic [&amp;_a]:text-link-inline mt-8 h-fit">For organizations with complex security, support, and performance needs</p><div class="mt-16 block flex items-end lg:h-64"><svg class="h-[42px]" viewBox="0 0 63 49"><use href="/_next/static/media/double-comment.ffc8a75e.svg#double-comment"></use></svg><span class="text-description text-foreground-tertiary ml-[0.5ch] leading-none font-medium"> <!-- -->Custom pricing</span></div><div class="my-32"><a class="_button_1my59_1" data-size="lg" data-fill="solid" data-color="accent" href="/contact/sales?ref=pricing-enterprise"><span class="opacity-0 transition-opacity">Contact sales</span></a><div class="mt-16 flex justify-center gap-x-8 opacity-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"><span class="text-details-md text-foreground-tertiary leading-[21px] font-medium">or</span><!--$--><a class="_linkCta_1qxez_1" data-arrow-direction="right" data-arrow-color="base" data-arrow-position="right" data-size="md" href="/contact/sales?ref=pricing-demo">Request a demo<span class="_arrow_1qxez_48"><span class="_icon_1qxez_67">→</span></span></a><!--/$--></div></div><div class="PlanCards_cardFeatures__8gjNb" data-plan="Enterprise"><p><strong>Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Custom # user seats</li><li>Custom roles and access control</li><li>Custom # datasets</li><li>Media Library (add-on)</li><li>Single sign-on with SAML</li><li>Dedicated support and uptime SLA</li><li>Onboarding program</li><li>Custom historical retention</li><li>Custom usage quota</li><li>Plus everything in Growth</li></ul></div></li></ul><div class="footer-text text-details-md lg:w-cols-6 mx-auto text-center text-balance">Prices are per month.</div><a class="_button_1my59_1 group/button text-details-md bg-white-dynamic hover:bg-background-neutral-hover mx-auto mt-16 flex w-fit justify-center gap-x-4 overflow-hidden rounded-full py-8 pr-16 pl-12 font-semibold transition-colors PlanCards_animateComparePlansButton__fYBpf" data-size="md" data-fill="solid" data-color="white" href="#compare-plans"><svg class="h-[21px] w-[21px] text-current PlanCards_animateComparePlansIcon__K5