=384&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format 1x, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/3do82whm/next/2aecc185422e53fedc050e28e7c3a435166d1711-294x147.svg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format 2x" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/3do82whm/next/2aecc185422e53fedc050e28e7c3a435166d1711-294x147.svg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="294" height="147" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full SanityImage_darkModeOnly__jIAOS" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/3do82whm/next/ca2030d901ae3279c7275aab3f62928c7f2b66dd-294x147.svg?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format 1x, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/3do82whm/next/ca2030d901ae3279c7275aab3f62928c7f2b66dd-294x147.svg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format 2x" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/3do82whm/next/ca2030d901ae3279c7275aab3f62928c7f2b66dd-294x147.svg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format"/></div><div class="flex flex-grow flex-col p-16"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-details-md text-purple-600-dynamic flex items-center font-medium"><svg class="-ml-[0.5ch] h-[1.5em]" data-icon="bolt" viewBox="0 0 25 25"><use href="/iconophor/sanity-icons/3.7.0/bolt?replace-colors=currentColor&amp;symbol=true#icon"></use></svg>Add-on</span><span class="text-details-md text-foreground-tertiary ml-auto font-medium">+ <span class="text-foreground-primary">$<!-- -->299</span> <!-- -->per month</span></div><h3 class="component-heading-sm mt-8 mb-12">Increased quota</h3><div class="text-description text-gray-600-dynamic [&amp;_a]:text-link-inline @light:[&amp;_li]:marker:text-purple-600 @dark:[&amp;_li]:marker:text-purple-300 mb-16 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li+li]:mt-8 [&amp;_ul]:pl-[1em]"><p>Extend the included quotas to 50k documents, 5M API CDN requests, 1M API requests, 500GB bandwidth, and 500GB assets.</p></div><div class="mt-auto"><!--$--><a class="mb-16 _linkCta_1qxez_1" data-arrow-directio