a10853d6423503-294x147.svg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format 2x" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/3do82whm/next/3b725b83c3a87322854893b47fa10853d6423503-294x147.svg?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format"/></div><div class="flex flex-grow flex-col p-16"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-details-md text-purple-600-dynamic flex items-center font-medium"><svg class="-ml-[0.5ch] h-[1.5em]" data-icon="bolt" viewBox="0 0 25 25"><use href="/iconophor/sanity-icons/3.7.0/bolt?replace-colors=currentColor&amp;symbol=true#icon"></use></svg>Add-on</span><span class="text-details-md text-foreground-tertiary ml-auto font-medium">+ <span class="text-foreground-primary">$<!-- -->999</span> <!-- -->per dataset / mo</span></div><h3 class="component-heading-sm mt-8 mb-12">Extra datasets</h3><div class="text-description text-gray-600-dynamic [&amp;_a]:text-link-inline @light:[&amp;_li]:marker:text-purple-600 @dark:[&amp;_li]:marker:text-purple-300 mb-16 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:leading-snug [&amp;_li+li]:mt-8 [&amp;_ul]:pl-[1em]"><p>Unlock up to 2 additional datasets for your project. Price is per extra dataset per month.</p></div><div class="mt-auto"><!--$--><a class="mb-16 _linkCta_1qxez_1" data-arrow-direction="right" data-arrow-color="base" data-arrow-position="left" data-size="md" href="/docs/platform-management/growth-plan-add-ons#f239f0ac9f79"><span class="_arrow_1qxez_48"><span class="_icon_1qxez_67">→</span></span>Read more</a><!--/$--><a class="_button_1my59_1 group/button :hover:!border-purple-300-dynamic text-details-md border-gray-200-dynamic text-foreground-primary hover:bg-purple-50-dynamic hover:text-purple-900-dynamic group-hover/card:border-purple-200-dynamic flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded border px-[20px] py-[10px] text-[14px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200" data-size="md" data-fill="solid" data-color="white" href="/manage?ref=pricing-datasets">Add to project</a></div></div></div></li